/target

# Lab-run report cache (lab-run-save-compare ADR-0055 § D1/D2).
# Git-ignored ⇒ never committed ⇒ invisible to `verify_anchors.sh`
# `find spec …` glob ⇒ 119 anchored report bodies are byte-immutable BY CONSTRUCTION.
/lab-runs/

# Runtime state — not source
# `/data/` excluded except for `data/yahoo/REVISION.toml` (revision-pin manifest
# committed per ADR-0040 / Q10=(b) so v0.1.1 anchor locks are reproducible).
# Bulk Yahoo parquets stay gitignored per the explicit rule below.
/data/*
!/data/yahoo/
/data/yahoo/*
!/data/yahoo/REVISION.toml
!/data/binance-funding/
/data/binance-funding/*
!/data/binance-funding/REVISION.toml
# Broader-universe spike (2026-06-02, universe-method-diagnosis § S): 35 mid-cap
# 2024 + 27 mid-cap 2023 hourly klines. Bulk parquets stay gitignored (mirrors
# data/binance); only the revision-pin manifest is tracked for reproducibility.
!/data/binance-broaduni/
/data/binance-broaduni/*
!/data/binance-broaduni/REVISION.toml
# Perp-spot-basis spike (2026-06-05, new-data-domain-scoping § Basis spike): the
# 10 large-cap premium-index (perp basis) hourly klines, 2023-2024, fetched by
# fetch_binance_premium. Bulk parquets stay gitignored (mirrors data/binance);
# only the revision-pin manifest (aggregate SHA aa72409a…) is tracked.
!/data/binance-basis/
/data/binance-basis/*
!/data/binance-basis/REVISION.toml
# 2021-22 hourly down-market corpus (feature binance-corpus-expansion,
# 2026-06-15): same 10 symbols as data/binance, 2021-2022. Bulk parquets
# gitignored (mirrors data/binance); only the REVISION.toml pin is tracked.
!/data/binance-2122/
/data/binance-2122/*
!/data/binance-2122/REVISION.toml
# On-chain stablecoin-supply spike (2026-06-08, onchain-netflow-spike): daily
# per-chain stablecoin circulating supply from the free DefiLlama API. Net-flows
# were ruled out at the PIT gate; stablecoin supply is the cleaner-PIT fallback.
# Bulk parquets stay gitignored (mirrors data/binance-basis); only the
# revision-pin manifest (aggregate SHA 782148bd…) is tracked for reproducibility.
!/data/defillama-stablecoins/
/data/defillama-stablecoins/*
!/data/defillama-stablecoins/REVISION.toml
# Deribit DVOL implied-vol corpus (advisor-options-impliedvol-probe, ADR-0072,
# 2026-06-26): daily BTC+ETH DVOL OHLC from Deribit get_volatility_index_data.
# Bulk parquets stay gitignored (mirrors data/binance-basis); only the
# REVISION.toml pin is tracked for reproducibility.
!/data/deribit-dvol/
/data/deribit-dvol/*
!/data/deribit-dvol/REVISION.toml
# Dynamic on-demand Binance klines cache (advisor-dynamic-data, ADR-0061).
# git-ignored by the existing `/data/*` rule above — this comment documents the
# intent. NO `!data/binance-dynamic/` exception is added: the dynamic cache is
# non-reproducible (live API; no REVISION pin), never committed, and
# invisible to `verify_anchors.sh` (which only walks spec/). Delete with
# `rm -rf data/binance-dynamic/` — it re-fetches on the next bake-off run.
/logs/
/snapshot/
/data-snapshot/

# Local-only config (Q3 = Option C from spec/v2-llm-strategy/feature.md):
# secrets and operator-specific overrides live in *.toml.local files
# alongside their committed *.toml siblings. Never commit these.
*.toml.local
config/*.local

# Yahoo Finance parquet cache (Q10 = (b) / ADR-0040 § D3).
# Bulk data is NOT redistributed per Yahoo TOS (K5); only
# `data/yahoo/REVISION.toml` and sample fixtures under
# `crates/data/tests/fixtures/yahoo/` are tracked.
# Note: `/data/` above already covers this; these lines are explicit
# documentation of the policy for future operators.
data/yahoo/**/*.parquet
!data/yahoo/REVISION.toml

# TCN checkpoints — gitignored except LFS-tracked anchors.
# Anchors live under crates/forecast/checkpoints/anchors/ (Wave C).
crates/forecast/checkpoints/*.safetensors
crates/forecast/checkpoints/*.metadata.json

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Build / test debris (stray rlib + ad-hoc test scratch files)
*.rlib
/test_field_method2

# Python bytecode cache (scripts/ tooling — e.g. check_determinism_anchors.py,
# run as part of the verify-anchors gate per ADR-0045 § D7.1).
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# CodeGraph code-knowledge-graph index — local per-machine artifact (46MB SQLite DB),
# rebuilt with `codegraph init` / auto-synced. Never committed. See spec/dev-notes/codegraph.md.
.codegraph/

# On-demand Binance dynamic-data cache when a -p backtest test resolves it crate-relative (ADR-0061; data, never committed)
crates/backtest/data/
